<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>iOS UIKit Course</title><link>/docs/useful-tools-and-ui-elements/bottom-sheet-view-modal-presentation/</link><description>Recent content on iOS UIKit Course</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><atom:link href="/docs/useful-tools-and-ui-elements/bottom-sheet-view-modal-presentation/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>1. Creating the Screen for a Bottom Sheet View</title><link>/docs/useful-tools-and-ui-elements/bottom-sheet-view-modal-presentation/1.-creating-the-screen-for-a-bottom-sheet-view/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/useful-tools-and-ui-elements/bottom-sheet-view-modal-presentation/1.-creating-the-screen-for-a-bottom-sheet-view/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="71-creating-the-screen-for-a-bottom-sheet-view"&gt;7.1. Creating the Screen for a Bottom Sheet View&lt;a class="anchor" href="#71-creating-the-screen-for-a-bottom-sheet-view"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;When building a bottom sheet (presentation) view, we must remember that the page we will present as a bottom sheet is a full and independent screen. It should have its own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;View Controller&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigation Controller&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; So, let&amp;rsquo;s design a separate screen for our search bottom sheet. Let&amp;rsquo;s create the following three Swift files:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SearchBottomSheetController.swift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SearchBottomSheetView.swift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SearchTableCell.swift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="../../.gitbook/assets/Screenshot%202023-06-13%20at%201.12.04%20PM.png" alt="" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;rsquo;s design the view first.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2. Setting up the Controller for the Search Bottom Sheet</title><link>/docs/useful-tools-and-ui-elements/bottom-sheet-view-modal-presentation/2.-setting-up-the-controller-for-the-search-bottom-sheet/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/useful-tools-and-ui-elements/bottom-sheet-view-modal-presentation/2.-setting-up-the-controller-for-the-search-bottom-sheet/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="72-setting-up-the-controller-for-the-search-bottom-sheet"&gt;7.2. Setting up the Controller for the Search Bottom Sheet&lt;a class="anchor" href="#72-setting-up-the-controller-for-the-search-bottom-sheet"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;rsquo;s open SearchBottomSheetController.swift file. We will mostly use the same code here as &lt;a href="../6.-search-bar/" title="mention"&gt;6.-search-bar&lt;/a&gt;. We would add a few more logic to handle a tap on a row and send data back to the main screen. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;rsquo;s write the code for setting up the table view and the search bar. Let&amp;rsquo;s open SearchBottomSheetController.swift file, and put the following code there:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;{% code lineNumbers=&amp;ldquo;true&amp;rdquo; %}&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>3. Main Screen</title><link>/docs/useful-tools-and-ui-elements/bottom-sheet-view-modal-presentation/3.-main-screen/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/useful-tools-and-ui-elements/bottom-sheet-view-modal-presentation/3.-main-screen/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="3-main-screen"&gt;3. Main Screen&lt;a class="anchor" href="#3-main-screen"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The main screen is very simple to design; we have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A label to display the selected name from the bottom search sheet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Find button to pop the bottom search sheet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="main-screen-view"&gt;Main Screen View&lt;a class="anchor" href="#main-screen-view"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;rsquo;s create a file named MainScreenView.swift:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="../../.gitbook/assets/Screenshot%202023-06-13%20at%201.35.29%20PM.png" alt="" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;rsquo;s put the following code there:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-swift" data-lang="swift"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// MainScreenView.swift&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// BottomSheetViewDemo&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// Created by Sakib Miazi on 6/13/23.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;UIKit&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;MainScreenView&lt;/span&gt;: UIView {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; labelName: UILabel!
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; buttonSelect: UIButton!
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;override&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;init&lt;/span&gt;(frame: CGRect) {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;super&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;init&lt;/span&gt;(frame: frame)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;.backgroundColor = .white
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;MARK:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt; initializing labelName...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; labelName = UILabel()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; labelName.text = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Tap Find to search a name...&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; labelName.translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints = &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;.addSubview(labelName)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;MARK:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt; initializing buttonSelect...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; buttonSelect = UIButton(type: .system)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; buttonSelect.setTitle(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Find&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;: .normal)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; buttonSelect.setImage(UIImage(systemName: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;magnifyingglass.circle.fill&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;: .normal)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; buttonSelect.translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints = &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;.addSubview(buttonSelect)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;MARK:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt; initializing constraints...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; NSLayoutConstraint.activate([
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; buttonSelect.topAnchor.constraint(equalTo: &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;.safeAreaLayoutGuide.topAnchor, constant: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;32&lt;/span&gt;),
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; buttonSelect.centerXAnchor.constraint(equalTo: &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;.safeAreaLayoutGuide.centerXAnchor),
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; labelName.topAnchor.constraint(equalTo: buttonSelect.bottomAnchor, constant: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;16&lt;/span&gt;),
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; labelName.centerXAnchor.constraint(equalTo: &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;.safeAreaLayoutGuide.centerXAnchor),
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; ])
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;required&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;init&lt;/span&gt;?(coder: NSCoder) {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; fatalError(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;init(coder:) has not been implemented&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="main-screen-controller"&gt;Main Screen Controller&lt;a class="anchor" href="#main-screen-controller"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now it&amp;rsquo;s time to patch the actions to pop the bottom search sheet from the view controller. Let&amp;rsquo;s put the following code in ViewController.swift:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>4. Sending data back to Main Screen</title><link>/docs/useful-tools-and-ui-elements/bottom-sheet-view-modal-presentation/4.-sending-data-back-to-main-screen/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/useful-tools-and-ui-elements/bottom-sheet-view-modal-presentation/4.-sending-data-back-to-main-screen/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="74-sending-data-back-to-main-screen"&gt;7.4. Sending data back to Main Screen&lt;a class="anchor" href="#74-sending-data-back-to-main-screen"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will use Notification Center to do that. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We will observe any notifications coming from the bottom search sheet if the user selects any of the names in the main screen&amp;rsquo;s ViewController.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We will post notifications from SearchBottomSheetController when the user selects a table view row.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;rsquo;s open ViewController.swift file, and update the file with the following code:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;{% code lineNumbers=&amp;ldquo;true&amp;rdquo; %}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-swift" data-lang="swift"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// ViewController.swift&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// BottomSheetViewDemo&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// Created by Sakib Miazi on 6/13/23.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;UIKit&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ViewController&lt;/span&gt;: UIViewController {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//codes omitted...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; notificationCenter = NotificationCenter.&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;default&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;override&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;loadView&lt;/span&gt;() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; view = mainScreen
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;override&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;viewDidLoad&lt;/span&gt;() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//codes omitted&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; observeNameSelected() 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//codes omitted...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;MARK:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt; Observe if the user selected a name from bottom sheet...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;observeNameSelected&lt;/span&gt;(){
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; notificationCenter.addObserver(
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; selector: &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;#selector&lt;/span&gt;(onNameSelected(notification:)),
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; name: .nameSelected, object: &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;@objc&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;onNameSelected&lt;/span&gt;(notification: Notification){
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; selectedName = notification.object{
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; mainScreen.labelName.text = selectedName &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt;! String
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;{% endcode %}&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>5. Reference Code</title><link>/docs/useful-tools-and-ui-elements/bottom-sheet-view-modal-presentation/5.-reference-code/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/useful-tools-and-ui-elements/bottom-sheet-view-modal-presentation/5.-reference-code/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="75-reference-code"&gt;7.5. Reference Code&lt;a class="anchor" href="#75-reference-code"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;{% file src=&amp;quot;../../.gitbook/assets/BottomSheetView.zip&amp;quot; %}&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>